control: A verdict made under another scanner returns to pending, cleared, with its sender's prior hits counted again
removes: a backfill run returns stale verdicts to pending only after its first pass ends, so they keep releasing bodies while it runs or fails
packages: ./backfill
tests: TestAChangeOfScannerMasksAndScansAgain
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

